# T_SCRE: the Service tab of item 5 (oldest service date first): Ins
# opens a new record for the item, Ctrl-S refuses it while the type and
# then the summary are empty, the record is added; its notes are
# written with the memo editor and saved, then shown; a record deleted
# after asking; Esc back to the form.
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER ALT-C S
S TAB5
K INS
S NEW
K CTRL-S
S REQTYPE
K SPACE CTRL-S
S REQSUM
T New drive belts
K TAB
T 8.5
K TAB
T Otto
K CTRL-S
S ADDED
K END CTRL-E PGDN F4
S MEMONEW
T Belts from the spares box.
K ENTER
T Both fitted.
K CTRL-S
S MEMOSAVE
K CTRL-S
S SAVED2
K ENTER PGDN F4
S MEMOSHOW
K ESC ESC HOME DEL
S DELQ
T Y
S DELETED
K ESC
S FORM
K ESC ESC
